# Photographer Portfolio Template
A modern, responsive landing page template for photographers and filmmakers.
## Features
- 📱 Mobile First
- ⚡ Next.js 14 (app Router)
- 🎨 Tailwind CSS
- ✨ Framer Motion animations
- 🧩 shadcn/ui components
- 🔍 SEO optimized
- 📷 Portfolio gallery
- 💬 WhatsApp CTA
- ❓ FAQ section
## Tech Stack
- Next.js
- React
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- shadcn/ui
- Framer Motion
- Lucide React
